[27.579421, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/nonna-app\u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m. Let me first look at the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btest\u001b[8Gto\u001b[11Gunderstand\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gexact\u001b[32Grequirement,\u001b[45Gthen\u001b[50Gexamine\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gcurrent\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gimp\u001b[7Gementation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I can see\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gissue.\u001b[28GThe\u001b[32Gcurrent\u001b[40G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[52G\u001b[39muses\u001b[57Gfloor\u001b[63Gdivision\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m),\u001b[9Gwhich\u001b[15Gdrops\u001b[21Gfractions.\u001b[32GFor\u001b[36G7350\u001b[41G/\u001b[43G100\u001b[47G=\u001b[49G73.5,\u001b[55Git\u001b[58Greturns\u001b[66G73\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Ginstead of 74\u001b[17G(rounding half\u001b[32Gup).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll fix this\u001b[17Gusing \u001b[25Gteger arithmetic\u001b[42Gto\u001b[45Gimplement\u001b[55Ground-half-up:\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=j806qk;file:///root/nonna-app/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
