5mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m fix already existed:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtest_half_cent_rounds_up()\u001b[30G\u001b[39mand\u001b[34G\u001b[38;5;105mtest_tax_rounds_half_up()\u001b[60G\u001b[39min\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtests/test_money.py pin the required behavior. These\u001b[56Gtests\u001b[62Gfail\r\u001b[1B  without my change (returning 73 instead of 74) and pass with it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
